 137:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c **** /*============================================*/
 138:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c **** /*
 139:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****   Description:
 140:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     Update a sub area of the display, given by tile position, width and height.
 141:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     The arguments are "tile" coordinates. Any u8g2 rotation is ignored.
 142:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     This procedure only checks whether full buffer mode is active.
 143:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     There is no error checking for the arguments: It is the responsibility of the
 144:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     user to ensure, that the provided arguments are correct.
 145:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c **** 
 146:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****   Limitations:
 147:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     - Only available in full buffer mode (will not do anything in page mode)
 148:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     - Tile positions and sizes (pixel position divided by 8)
 149:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     - Any display rotation/mirror is ignored
 150:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     - Only works with displays, which support U8x8 API
 151:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c ****     - Will not send the e-paper refresh message (will probably not work with e-paper devices)
 152:BSP/u8g2/u8g2_buffer.c **** */
